# The agent example infers its layer on first run and caches it next to the
# script. Committing that cache pins every clone to whichever engine built it,
# because _ensure_layer() returns early when the file exists -- so the example
# stops demonstrating inference and starts replaying a snapshot of it.
examples/agent_pipeline/layer.yaml
examples/agent_pipeline/layer.yaml.report.json
